      "created_at": "2012-11-29T16:57:33.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>After this amazing Kickstarter campaign, I'm in the same overexcited-flaying-around-state as the last update.</p><p>I need something to let the excitment out.</p><p>Here si my idea for a fun , decompression topic !&nbsp; post it in the off-topic forum because it ismeant to be SILLY.</p><p>Some times ago, while joking about the number of Wraith promo cards, Paul hinted that the 200k reward would be 365 days of Wraith cards. Thankfully for him, this goal was not reached :) However this joke led me to wonder what kind of \"derived products\" about the Multiverse &gt;G could publish...</p><p>What are your ideas ? Oh, and by the way, even if we do this for fun, le's make an greement that all these ideas are property of &gt;G and not ours, just in case they find one interesting :D</p><p>So Paul already had the idea of The Wraith Calendar ! 365 days of Maia art ! With a mysterious hint from Chistopher on each page !</p><p>I would add the Sentinels of the Multiverse Gameplay Calendar : on each page, a game set up of heroes, villain and enviroment ! What will you play today ?</p><p>The Wraith Fashion Game for Girls : Maia may be a mysterious crime-fighter AND the CEO of a big corporation, but she still is a fashionable girl ! Help her to be always perfectly clothed for her activities by drawing apropriate outfits for each and every situation ! What does she wear when fighting Plague Rat in the sewers ? At the Woman of the Year Gala ? At the pool ? For tea ? For tea with Baron Blade ? Draw it !</p><p>Savage Haka Educational Videos for children ! From physics to alchemy, martial arts to cocktail preparation, learn new things with the help of the Friendly Haka and its heroic guest stars !</p><p>Absolute Zero's anti-depression herbal tea !</p><p>Baron Blade's guide to correspondance writing : you don't know how to redact a good job request ? Or proletarian propaganda ? Whatever the subject, Baron Blade can give you tips on the best way to convince by the written word !</p><p>Chrono-Ranger wrist-watches. Right handed only.</p><p>What are your ideas ?</p>",
